<title>USA: Baldwin &amp; Lyons Inc Q4 net up.</title>
<headline>Baldwin &amp; Lyons Inc Q4 net up.</headline>
<dateline>INDIANAPOLIS 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.37		    $0.27</p>
<p> Net			  5,318		    3,973</p>
<p> Revs			20,034		   21,600</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>		 Year</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.51		    $1.97</p>
<p> Net			 21,692		   29,360</p>
<p> Revs			86,487		   86,328</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Excluding realized net gain on investments of $0.06/shr and earnings from discontinued operations of $0.01/shr, 1996 Q4 shr was $0.30. Excluding realized net loss on investments of $0.03/shr and gain on sale of Hoosier Insurance Co of $0.01/shr, 1995 Q4 shr was $0.29/shr.</p>
<p>Excluding realized net gain on investments of $0.31/shr and earnings from discontinued operations of $0.02/shr, 1996 12-mos shr was $1.18. Excluding realized net gain on investments of $0.27/shr and gain on sale of Hoosier Insurance Co of $0.51/shr, 1995 12-mos shr was $1.11.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
